  "body": "Single-Level Brick Home | Coastal Lifestyle | Walk to Beaches & Parks\r\n\r\nOVERSEAS-BOUND VENDOR – MUST BE SOLD UNDER THE HAMMER!\r\n\r\nEnjoy privacy, comfort and relaxed coastal living in this well-presented single-level brick home, superbly positioned in sought-after Eastern Beach and within the prestigious Macleans College zone. With the vendor heading overseas, motivation is high and the instruction is clear – this property MUST BE SOLD!\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned at 2/29 Vivian Wilson Drive, the home offers three well-proportioned bedrooms, thoughtfully separated from the main living areas to provide extra privacy, peace and quiet for the whole family.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a modern, functional kitchen with excellent storage and a separate pantry, flowing seamlessly to the dining area and spacious lounge. Large windows invite plenty of natural light, while a heat pump provides year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nStep outside to the private, easy-care backyard – a peaceful spot to relax in the sunshine, entertain family and friends, or simply enjoy outdoor living without demanding maintenance.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• Solid single-level brick home – practical and low maintenance\r\n• 3 well-proportioned bedrooms, separated from the living areas for added privacy\r\n• Modern kitchen with excellent storage and separate pantry\r\n• Spacious lounge and dining area plus heat pump\r\n• Family bathroom, separate WC and separate laundry\r\n• Internal-access garage plus private, easy-care backyard\r\n• Zoned for Macleans College, BBI & Bucklands Beach Primary School\r\n• Easy walk to beaches, parks and reserves\r\n\r\nLocation is a standout. Enjoy the relaxed Eastern Beach lifestyle with beautiful beaches, parks and reserves within easy walking distance, while local shops and everyday amenities are conveniently close at hand.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, downsizer, small family or investor, this is an exciting opportunity to secure a private, easy-care brick home in a premium coastal location and highly sought-after school zones.\r\n\r\nOverseas-bound vendor. Genuine motivation. This home MUST BE SOLD!\r\n\r\nCall us today for more information or to arrange a private viewing. We warmly welcome you to our open homes.",
